<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 270)</h2>
<p><b>Web Review polish, and one app fix.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Web: speed control now sticks (and drives the whole session at that rate), loop and ping-pong actually loop at the clip tail, boxes and arrows preview as their real shape while you drag, the volume slider stops being chunky, and silent clips no longer pretend to have a waveform.</li>
<li>App: <b>global session notes no longer follow you into new sessions</b> — they were persisting through the report header. They stay with the session they belong to (and still save/load with its file).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
